.TH EASE_OUT_BACK 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
ease_out_back \- Overshoots the target slightly and settles back
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "float ease_out_back(float t);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Overshoots the target slightly and settles back. Pop\-ups, score bumps, anything that should feel springy. Values briefly exceed 1.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the eased value, up to about 1.1.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ease_out_bounce (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
